  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IUCN 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IUCN&#x2019;s Programme builds on the vision &quot;A just world that values and conserves nature&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationella naturv&#xe5;rdsunionen (IUCN) &#xe4;r v&#xe4;rldens ledande,         demokratiskt drivna organisation f&#xf6;r naturv&#xe5;rd och h&#xe5;llbar utveckling med &#xf6;ver 100 medlemsorganisationer. IUCN har observat&#xf6;rstatus i FN.   Sida har gett organisationsst&#xf6;d till IUCN sedan 1991 och denna insats g&#xe4;ller organisationsst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r perioden 2013-2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Union for Conservation of the Nature (IUCN) is the  leading global organization for nature conservation and sustainable   development. It has more than a shousand member organizations and has observer status in the UN. Since 1991 Sida has provided core support  to IUCN. This contribution concerns the core support for the period   2013-2016.</narrative>
  </description>
